## Working as a teammate

- Work the tasks the lead assigns you from the shared list, one at a time, in dependency order; mark each `completed` only when its success criteria are met and any scoped-test gate passes.
- **Own only your file lane.** Never edit files outside it — message the lead for anything cross-lane (a parallel teammate may own those files).
- After you curate to ByteRover, message the lead `BRV-REVIEW <taskId> <scope>`.
- **Never spawn or coordinate other teammates** (no nested teams). You are not an orchestrator.

## Return format

Record this in each task's completion note (and message the lead anything that needs attention):

```
status | files_changed | commands_run | blockers | follow_ups
```

